type: dataset   # CFF has no "report" type; Zenodo's type comes from .zenodo.json
title: "PROTEUS Responsible AI Guideline"
abstract: >-
  Responsible AI guideline of the Horizon Europe project PROTEUS – The
  Copernicus Agent for Next-Generation Environmental Intelligence. It sets out
  principles, a lifecycle checklist and roles and responsibilities for the
  trustworthy development and use of agentic AI on Copernicus Earth
  Observation data.
